1
00:00:00,622 --> 00:00:02,582
(Penny:)But we were never, like, going out.

2
00:00:02,749 --> 00:00:04,709
(Leonard:)Okay. Not to be pedantic,
the last I checked...

3
00:00:04,876 --> 00:00:07,466
..."went out" was the past tense
of "going out"...

4
00:00:07,629 --> 00:00:09,799
(Leonard:)...which I think we all know
is a popular euphemism...

5
00:00:09,965 --> 00:00:12,215
(Leonard:)...for saw each other naked.

6
00:00:13,343 --> 00:00:15,343
(Sheldon:)I'll just roll for you.

7
00:00:16,138 --> 00:00:18,388
(Penny:)You have a problem
with Justin staying with me?

8
00:00:18,557 --> 00:00:19,977
(Leonard:)What was your first clue?

9
00:00:20,142 --> 00:00:22,932
Uh-oh. Industrial accident.

10
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,520
(Penny:)Know what?
Don't talk to me like an idiot.

11
00:00:25,689 --> 00:00:29,439
I'm not talking to you like an idiot.
I'm saying the whole idea is idiotic.

12
00:00:29,609 --> 00:00:34,489
"You accidentally stare at a helium-argon
laser. Lose one turn and a retina."

13
00:00:34,656 --> 00:00:36,656
How's that not talking to me
like I'm an idiot?

14
00:00:36,825 --> 00:00:39,535
(Penny:)It's my friend, it's my couch
and it's my freaking life.

15
00:00:39,703 --> 00:00:41,333
(Sheldon:)It's also your roll.

16
00:00:41,621 --> 00:00:43,371
(Leonard:)You know what? It is your life.

17
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:46,330
If you wanna have some stupid guitarist
stay on your couch, fine!

18
00:00:46,501 --> 00:00:49,631
Why don't you just rent bunk beds
and invite the Black Eyed Peas?

19
00:00:49,796 --> 00:00:54,216
Hey, if I wanna invite the line-up
of Lollapalooza to my apartment, I will.

20
00:00:54,384 --> 00:00:55,714
(Penny:)It's none of your business.

21
00:00:55,886 --> 00:00:58,306
(Leonard:)Do you know how childish you sound
right now?

22
00:00:58,471 --> 00:01:02,681
-Oh, now I'm a child. Not an idiot anymore.
-Hey, the two aren't mutually exclusive.

